# ROS / OT FORENSICS TOOLS

Registered tools for the ros domain:
- inspect_ros — introspect a live ROS 1 / ROS 2 node graph,
  topics, and parameter surface (medium risk; exec:shell).
- analyze_safety_config — static safety-config drift & tamper
  audit against a reference baseline (low risk, read-only).

Execute in investigation order: introspect the graph, then audit
the safety configuration against its baseline. Live introspection
runs only within the authorized scope; the static audit is always
passive.
